<title>USA: Crestar Financial oks stock split, ups div.</title>
<headline>Crestar Financial oks stock split, ups div.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crestar Financial Corp said Friday that its board has authorized a two-for-one common stock split to be distributed January 24 to shareholders of record January 3.</p>
<p>The company said it will also increase its quarterly dividend to $0.54 per share from $0.52. After the split, the dividend will be $0.27 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>It said the dividend will be paid February 21 to shareholders of record February 3.</p>
</text>
